repository-code: https://github.com/Raytracer76/IntentGraph
abstract: >-
  IntentGraph is a static code analysis CLI tool optimized for AI agent
  context windows. It analyzes Python, JavaScript, TypeScript, Go, Java,
  and Kotlin codebases and generates token-efficient structured output
  designed to fit within AI agent context limitations.
keywords:
  - static analysis
  - code analysis
  - AI agents
  - context window
  - dependency graph
  - Python
  - JavaScript
  - TypeScript
